          "Recognize that 31.6-year median age means this constituency evaluates on whether government is delivering tangible economic improvements, not partisan identity — a representative who combines Democratic alignment with concrete policy on housing, wages, education costs, and job creation is far more durable than one who assumes partisan loyalty is sufficient."
