          "Consolidate the 57% actively and do not assume it holds: nearly half the district voted for the opposition in the last cycle, and the college-educated demographic cohort is more persuadable than partisan affiliation alone would suggest. Active communication on governance competence, constituent service, and specific delivery on promised priorities is required to maintain this margin."
