          { name: "Urban Density & Progressive Social Policy", tag: "avoid", why: "The low renter rate (22.9%), high median age (46.5), and homogeneous demographics indicate a stable, owner-occupied, socially conservative population unlikely to prioritize urban renewal, progressive criminal justice reform, or identity-based policy initiatives. A 61-39 Republican margin confirms voters have rejected this framing; doubling down on it wastes credibility and resources." }
