          "Lead with suburban quality-of-life governance: schools, property tax fairness, infrastructure maintenance, healthcare access, and local service costs are the material concerns of a $82,884 median-income, 33.5% college-educated, 77.8% homeowner constituency. Specific, achievable proposals on these issues outperform abstract ideological positioning in a district this competitive.",
